{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15104200","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15104200","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:4:1510420001:0":{"text":"ごほん。来訪者よ、余がホーリン城の領主である。","source_cn":"咳嗯。外来者，你们正在觐见呼临城的领主。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB614E06384F6C3FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510420002:0":{"text":"こたびの来訪の目的を述べよ！","source_cn":"说明你们的来意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C77A9F52ADAF25F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510420003:0":{"text":"……子ども？","source_cn":"……小孩？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E8373446D68F4DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510420004:0":{"text":"なっ、だ、誰が子どもだ！？","source_cn":"你、你说什么，谁是小孩？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D24650475ACADBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510420005:0":{"text":"親愛なるアバルド殿下、どうかお怒りをお鎮めください。我々魔法協会は、以前よりホーリン城を脅かす飢饉と干ばつについて、調査を続けておりました。","source_cn":"尊敬的阿邦德殿下啊，请息怒。我们是魔法师协会，一直在研...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2ABC58039D2853","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1510420006:0":{"text":"そして、現状を改善する方法を発見したのです。魔法で皆さまの力になれるかもしれません。どうか、我々が城内で魔法を行使できる許可をお与えください。","source_cn":"现在，我们已经想出了能改变现状的方法。希望您能赐予魔法...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x041C0E2C3E07ED9F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1510420007:1":{"text":"ペルセウスが言っていたが、ホーリン城は病にかかった病人で、そなたらはそれを治す医者だそうだな。","source_cn":"呃，珀尔修斯说过，呼临城是生病的人，你们是来治疗的医师。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5109D6AD97627480","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510420008:0":{"text":"殿下、それは比喩にございます。","source_cn":"那是一种比喻，殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDC6FE63B8B7851F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510420009:1":{"text":"え、そうなのか？とにかく、そなたらは悪人ではないとペルセウスが言っていた。","source_cn":"呃，是吗？不管怎样，珀尔修斯说你们是好人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x571610170D6C585D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510420010:0":{"text":"ペルセウスが保証するなら、余が断る理由もないだろう！","source_cn":"他给你们担保，那我也不会不同意！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBFD6764036DE1F94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1510420011:0":{"text":"ホーリン城の領主として、そなたらに……色々権限を与えるぞ！","source_cn":"作为呼临城领主，我给你们……各种权力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x82A13FD461EAC8A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510420012:1":{"text":"これでよいか、ペルセウス？","source_cn":"这样就可以了吗，珀尔修斯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C8054251BB5790C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510420013:0":{"text":"はい。ホーリンの民は、殿下の賢明なご判断に感謝するでしょう。","source_cn":"呼临城会感激殿下的英明。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB512C484A72855E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510420014:0":{"text":"うむ、それならよし！では、もう下がってよいぞ。","source_cn":"嗯，那就好！可以带他们下去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2BE8B1C329B4F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510420015:0":{"text":"はっ。","source_cn":"是。<key:dialog7>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x464C72B88D8828DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510420016:1":{"text":"……あ、ちょっと待て！","source_cn":"……诶，等等！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC4BAE27E0172E19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1510420017:0":{"text":"そこの、耳が大きい女子（おなご）。そなたは何者だ？","source_cn":"那个有大耳朵的女孩，你是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFA184EC2AFAD7203","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1510420018:0":{"text":"ガーラは<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまのしもべです。","source_cn":"加拉是<style=stress><player_na...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFAC7C773317C9940","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"ガーラは<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまのしもべです。","female":"ガーラは<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>さまのしもべです。","variant_male_record_index":"178763","variant_female_record_index":"178764","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1510420019:0":{"text":"そ、そなたは獣人か？大きな耳に、長い尻尾まである……","source_cn":"你……你是兽人？有大耳朵，还有好长的尾巴。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55E65216CA594C0F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1510420020:1":{"text":"面白い！余も獣人のしもべがほしいぞ。","source_cn":"真有趣，我也想要一个兽人仆人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD39F669C8FC970D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1510420021:0":{"text":"殿下！彼らは我々の客人です。魔法協会との協力を損なうようなことは……","source_cn":"殿下！这不是呼临城的待客之道，我们还仰仗魔法师协会的协助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB900EC2BE13A84C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1510420022:0":{"text":"うっ……分かった……","source_cn":"唔……好吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD0534B1849839EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1510420023:1":{"text":"ビルボ先生の言うとおりだな。獣人は本当に獣に似ている。そなたも人を噛んだり、生肉を食べたりするのか？","source_cn":"比博老师说得没错，兽人果然更像野兽。你是不是也咬人、吃生肉？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5D45C1CEF15CB510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1510420024:0":{"text":"ガーラは生肉は食べませんが、人は噛みます。とても痛いです。","source_cn":"加拉不吃生肉，但是加拉咬人。而且很疼。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF1ABB5FB9C76C2B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1510420025:0":{"text":"嫌いな人は特に強く噛みます！","source_cn":"尤其是讨厌的人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB3AF3E4E65D6311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1510420026:0":{"text":"……ひっ！な、なんて恐ろしい！","source_cn":"……噫！真可怕！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA620A99FE6DF083","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1510420027:0":{"text":"ペルセウス、は、早くこいつらを下がらせろ！獣人のしもべなんていらない！","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，快、快把他们带下去！我不要兽人仆人了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C02E137A6281F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1510420028:0":{"text":"……承知しました。","source_cn":"……是。殿下。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA53F780018068C3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:41:1510420029:0":{"text":"ペルセウスは、あなたたちを連れて外に出た。","source_cn":"珀尔修斯带你们离开了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D8DCC0D2E096FB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1510420030:0":{"text":"まさか領主が子どもだったとはね。道理で国がこのザマになるわけだ。","source_cn":"没想到领主竟然是个小孩，怪不得呼临城会变成这幅惨象。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A07F9C26DBD5D05","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1510420031:0":{"text":"よそ者が知った風な口をきくな。まだ幼い殿下には、我々の補佐が必要なのだ。","source_cn":"领主年幼，需要旁人辅佐，轮不到外人置喙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x925316DC55F898A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1510420032:1":{"text":"無遠慮な物言いは慎んでくれ。","source_cn":"该闭嘴的时候，把嘴闭上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B012FA6055F510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:47:1510420032":{"text":"無遠慮な物言いは慎んでくれ。","source_cn":"该闭嘴的时候，把嘴闭上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B012FA6055F510","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1510420034:0":{"text":"どこかで今後の計画を話し合おう。こっちだ。","source_cn":"先找个地方从长商议之后的行动。跟我来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37055CF25BA65867","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:47:0:1":{"text":"これからどうする？","source_cn":"接下来怎么办？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD80E3ADD02639831","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"これからどうする？","female":"これからどうする？","variant_male_record_index":"76276","variant_female_record_index":"76277","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:47:1:2":{"text":"早速、城内に魔法陣を設置するか？","source_cn":"我们立刻开始在城内设阵施法？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x526073A57B3B305E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"早速、城内に魔法陣を設置するか？","female":"早速、城内に魔法陣を設置する？","variant_male_record_index":"76278","variant_female_record_index":"76279","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1510420033:0":{"text":"はっ、なかなかユーモアのある新人だな。","source_cn":"看，这新人至少还有点幽默感。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x987E5F3